--- title
# Velis

--- body
Local-first workspace with collaborative editing and synchronization across devices.

--- actions
[Product](https://velis.vu/) · [Portfolio](/en/#products)
:::

::: section architecture
## Architecture

Velis combines a web workspace, device-local persistence and application services for shared work.

- **Workspace:** documents, notes, tasks, editor surfaces and shared resources.
- **Local persistence:** browser-side data and pending changes retained for offline editing.
- **Synchronization:** exchange of local changes and remote updates through application services.
- **Collaborative editing:** operation-based document updates and real-time collaboration modules.
- **Server:** workspace management, access to shared resources, persistent data and event delivery.

The editing interface uses local state while the synchronization layer connects device changes to shared application data.
:::

::: section technologies
## Technologies

- **Web:** Next.js, React, TypeScript, Zustand.
- **Local storage:** IndexedDB and Dexie.
- **Collaboration:** Yjs, WebSocket and Socket.IO.
- **Backend:** NestJS, Prisma, PostgreSQL.
- **Messaging and services:** Redis.
:::

